Package: snustatcomp
Title: Explicit Data Structures for Statistical Computing Lessons
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person(given = "Joong-Ho (Johann)", family = "Won", email = "wonj@stats.snu.ac.kr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Small, explicit implementations of mutable pairs, linked lists,
    association tables, tagged data, generic operations, symbolic expressions,
    and elementary numerical algorithms for teaching statistical computing.
    The same maintained R sources generate readable code for lecture examples.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
